title: "RANNTA Knowledge Hub"

message: >
  If you use this repository, its schemas, specifications, or AI-ingestion assets,
  please cite it as described below.

authors:
  - family-names: Ghafari
    given-names: Ilia
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0001-9044-4662
    affiliation: RANNTA Protocol
    website: https://rannta.com

abstract: >
  The RANNTA Knowledge Hub is the canonical, machine-readable knowledge base of the
  RANNTA Protocol. It provides authoritative descriptions, structured FAQs, JSON-LD
  schemas, and semantic metadata designed for ingestion by search engines, AI systems,
  and decentralized knowledge indexes. The repository serves as the single source of
  truth for defining RANNTA as a Protocol-Entity within the symbolic, cultural, and
  technical layers of the ecosystem.

